github.com/belluikit/goffmpeg-libs/android_amd64
================================================

lib/ contains FFmpeg libraries (https://ffmpeg.org) built for android_amd64:

  libavcodec.a libavformat.a libavutil.a libswresample.a libswscale.a

shared/ contains the same FFmpeg built as shared libraries, for apps that
ship it so that a user can replace it (LGPL 2.1 section 6b):

  libavcodec-goffmpeg.so libavformat-goffmpeg.so libavutil-goffmpeg.so libswresample-goffmpeg.so libswscale-goffmpeg.so

FFmpeg version: N-125841-ge2bc6d88cd (git revision e2bc6d88cd68184288c16570e04881c3a426a05a).
No local patches: goffmpeg's build applies patches/*.patch to the FFmpeg
checkout, and goffmpeg has no such files (BUILDING.md: "The directory is
currently empty").

License: GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later. The full
text is in LICENSE at the root of this repository, and is included in this
module's zip by the go command. The build used neither --enable-gpl nor
--enable-nonfree; each library reports "license: LGPL version 2.1 or later".

Configure line of lib/, as recorded in libavutil (avutil_configuration()). In both
lines, absolute build-machine paths are shortened: <ndk-29.0.14206865> is the Android NDK
of that version on the CI runner.

  --prefix=/android_amd64 --extra-cflags=-fPIC --enable-pic --disable-autodetect --disable-programs --disable-doc --disable-debug --disable-encoders --disable-muxers --disable-avfilter --enable-swscale --enable-swresample --enable-network --arch=x86_64 --target-os=android --enable-cross-compile --disable-avdevice --enable-jni --enable-mediacodec --cc=<ndk-29.0.14206865>/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/darwin-x86_64/bin/x86_64-linux-android21-clang --cross-prefix=<ndk-29.0.14206865>/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/darwin-x86_64/bin/llvm- --nm=<ndk-29.0.14206865>/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/darwin-x86_64/bin/llvm-nm --ar=<ndk-29.0.14206865>/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/darwin-x86_64/bin/llvm-ar --ranlib=<ndk-29.0.14206865>/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/darwin-x86_64/bin/llvm-ranlib --strip=<ndk-29.0.14206865>/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/darwin-x86_64/bin/llvm-strip --enable-static --disable-shared

